        "subject": "LU-20853 build: Add systemd/systemd-dev to Build-Depends",
        "message": "LU-20853 build: Add systemd/systemd-dev to Build-Depends\n\nSince systemd 253-2, systemd.pc has been moved to systemd-dev, so\nwithout it configure can't find the unit dir and the deb packages\nare built without the systemd unit files.\n\nAdd systemd-dev or systemd older than 253-2 to Build-Depends, and\nrecheck systemd.pc in debian/rules so that make debs/dkms-debs works\nafter installing systemd-dev without rerunning configure. Use the\nnosystemd profile for --with-systemdsystemunitdir=no to skip both.\nAlso add a warning in configure as a reminder.\n\nTest-Parameters: trivial\nSigned-off-by: Xiao Yang <xyang@ddn.com>\nChange-Id: Ib4c5ae76fc08fa0477d004b210b1f70533a36afb\n"
      },
      "branch": "refs/heads/master"
    }
